[Music]  ready to give your mind a workout and  have a go with these 10 brain pieces to  test your mental sharpness if you're new  to our channel hit the red button down  below subscribe how many threes can you  see some brain teasers require you to  look very closely like this one how many  threes can you see ready for the answer  if you said 19 give yourself a high five  there are eight threes in the phone  number two threes on the keypad because  eight has been replaced three threes in  the time two threes in the battery power  and three of the letters in the contacts  name have been replaced four threes as  has the letter I on the number 14  if you don't only include the actual  symbol 3 then there are two more  occurrences in the network signal and  Wi-Fi signal both of which show three  bars train jacks people were losing  their minds over this train track  illusion when it went viral online how  is it possible for the two train tracks  to look like different links when  they're on the table but then line up  the same sides in place on top of each  other this is an example of the gestural  illusion from 100 years ago if you move  the top corner of the lower piece to  line up with the bottom corner of the  top piece the longer side and shorter  side are brought in to contrast light  switch there are three light switches  outside a closed door you have to figure  out which one controls the light inside  the room behind the closed door you can  only go into the room once to check  here's a clue you have to use more than  just your sense of sight here's the  answer  turn on two touches for ten minutes then  turn one of them off go straight into  the room if the light is on the switch  that is still on controls it if the  light is off feel the bulb if it's warm  the switch you just turned off controls  it if it's cold the switch that was  always off controlled it clever huh cork  bottle and coins ready for another one  this brainteaser test your ability to  think of alternative solutions to a  problem you have an empty wine bottle a  cork and a small coin you place the coin  inside the bottle and put the cork into  the neck how do you get the coin out  without taking out the cork  breaking the bottle here's a hint you  can do something else to the cork apart  from pulling it out here's the answer  you push the cork inside the bottle and  then shake out the coin screws math  puzzle  this fruit math puzzle looks like it's  simply testing your ability to add up  it's reasonably easy to figure out the  values of each of the fruit apples are  10 bananas are four coconuts or two so  when you work out the final line of the  puzzle you might automatically add up to  four coconut ten for an apple and four  for a banana to get 16 but look closely  there's only half a coconut and only  three bananas in the bunch  not four so the answer is 1 plus 10 plus  3 equals 14 face and coffee beans some  brain teasers ask you to find hidden  things within images like this one can  you spot the human face within the  coffee bean these kinds of puzzles  require close attention to detail and a  systematic approach to searching every  aspect of the picture  did you see the base it's on the bottom  left only one engine people managed to  see it so don't feel bad if you don't  elephant legs take a look at this  picture and tell us how many legs this  elephant has if your answer for you  might want to look again the feet and  legs aren't where they should be optical  illusions play with our perception of  the world we look at a picture of  something familiar and see what we think  ought to be there but when we look  closer we discover that it's actually  white different yellow but there are  certain puzzles that adults struggle  with but children will fall quickly like  this National Geographic brain game  which 80% of kids under 10 solve which  way is the bus traveling it seems  impossible to answer as the front and  back was the same but you need to think  about what is missing there are no doors  so that means they must be on the other  side in the US and countries where you  drive on the right the bus should be  traveling toward the left join the dots  this 9 dot puzzle is mind-boggling how  do you draw four continuous straight  lines that connect all the dots without  taking your pen off the paper  psychologists and philosophers have used  this puzzle to show how to unlock the  mind and problem solving what you have  to do is think outside the box  literally we automatically assumed the  Lions can extend beyond the boundary of  the dot but there's nothing in the  question that says you can't so you can  connect all nine dots by extending the  line at two points the bottom left and  pop right how should a dog wear pants  we're ending with a bit of fun the  internet went crazy deciding between two  options half the dog wore pants  Maxim's deputy editor asked Twitter  after tens of thousands of retweets and  like 81% went with pants on two legs the  image became a meme with lots of funny  versions like if a snake wore pants or  an axe or a man what do you think how  for the dog wear pants how many did you  solve let us know in the comments and  give our video a big thumbs up  [Music]

